WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:04.480
It's not fair! It's just not fair!

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:08.750
The two of them are working 
together? It's not fair!

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:11.170
They're so much better
 than us, all I can do is laugh.

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:17.450
But they don't seem to have actually 
decided whether or not they'll do it.

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:21.060
And we don't know what's up 
with sempai's rough draft.

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:25.270
If it happens, we totally lose.

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:29.240
I thought about this when
 Hato talked about her drawing,

00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:32.090
but do you have some
 kind of problem with them?

00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:36.320
No. Well, not exactly.

00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:39.840
To put it simply,

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:42.980
Yajimacchi, you are really amazing.

00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:48.630
When we started our little 
attempt at a "creative process,"

00:00:48.630 --> 00:00:51.240
I realized how hard it really is.

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:54.940
I know I should've known already, 
but I realized that I have no talent.

00:00:54.940 --> 00:00:58.270
So they scared me!

00:00:58.570 --> 00:01:01.240
When I heard we might not do
 our special edition of the magazine,

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:04.270
I honestly felt pretty relieved.

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:05.920
You...

00:01:07.050 --> 00:01:10.920
But you don't even hide 
how bad your work sucks!

00:01:11.570 --> 00:01:12.690
...are an asshole.

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:15.340
You talk about the complex 
you have towards Hato-chan,

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:19.740
but every issue you still
 draw a picture. A crappy picture!

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:22.540
Was it so important that 
you had to say it twice?

00:01:23.260 --> 00:01:28.020
Even if I drop out, you'll still 
draw something, won't you?

00:01:28.430 --> 00:01:30.470
Well, probably.

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:33.490
Then I can't drop out, I guess.

00:01:33.490 --> 00:01:36.310
Why not? Do what you want!

00:01:36.310 --> 00:01:39.070
You're not a pro like Ogiue-sempai.

00:01:39.310 --> 00:01:41.560
Ogi-sempai, huh?

00:01:41.560 --> 00:01:44.310
I wonder what she's going to draw.

00:01:44.650 --> 00:01:48.750
The romance talk we had 
didn't help with anything.

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:52.840
And I'm a bit worried about her pro work.

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:56.530
Shut up. Worry about yourself, not others.

00:01:56.530 --> 00:01:58.290
What?

00:01:58.290 --> 00:02:01.900
Decide if you're doing 
something with me or not.

00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:04.930
I want to, but...

00:02:04.930 --> 00:02:09.420
Then don't come up with ridiculously grand 
backstories until you've figured out a plot!

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:10.860
Make something small!

00:02:11.100 --> 00:02:13.610
But you have to dream big!

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:16.980
That's how you end up 
with absolutely nothing!

00:02:16.980 --> 00:02:19.170
There's no point unless you finish it!

00:02:19.950 --> 00:02:22.790
Yajimacchi is being mean.

00:03:57.460 --> 00:04:01.780
If you don't think it's 
interesting, nobody will.

00:04:04.200 --> 00:04:08.270
Maybe that's why Sue said 
I need a change of pace.

00:04:08.270 --> 00:04:09.730
Pikkon!

00:04:09.730 --> 00:04:12.040
You make the draft! You draw the pictures!

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:19.410
Hato-kun's art on top of my layouts...

00:04:20.090 --> 00:04:23.110
There's a Route, but There's No Loop.

00:04:26.470 --> 00:04:29.490
If Ogiue-sempai writes the draft,

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:34.500
then she'll do the layouts, so 
maybe I could do the finished art.

00:04:35.810 --> 00:04:41.210
It's true that I've always wanted 
to draw a manga in that style.

00:04:42.980 --> 00:04:47.340
But that style is just a copy of theirs.

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:50.660
And I can't do it unless 
I'm dressed like a girl.

00:05:00.030 --> 00:05:05.320
The ideal rotten girl that I want to 
be, that Ohno-sempai was talking about,

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:07.690
definitely isn't her.

00:05:07.690 --> 00:05:09.670
It's not me?

00:05:09.670 --> 00:05:13.220
It's true that I never see 
her when I'm cross-dressing.

00:05:13.220 --> 00:05:16.950
But her personality is too different from 
the original for me to want to be her.

00:05:16.950 --> 00:05:19.950
Okay, back to being the 
wonderful underclassman

00:05:19.950 --> 00:05:23.710
who hasn't seen his sempai in a long time,
 but still cleans up his apartment!

00:05:23.930 --> 00:05:26.270
Start with the dirty books!

00:05:26.270 --> 00:05:29.760
You can keep your mouth 
shut, so I'm going to clean.

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:37.430
It's true I haven't seen 
him for a while, though.

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:42.300
And the next thing I see is an H-game.

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:44.900
<b><i>Seven and a Half Laps to Paradise </i></b>

00:05:45.410 --> 00:05:47.290
Wait, isn't this...

00:05:47.290 --> 00:05:51.950
The trap game that Kohsaka-sempai
 was advertising at Comic Festival?

00:05:56.170 --> 00:05:58.610
It's the character he was cosplaying!

00:05:58.610 --> 00:06:00.810
Does this character have any?

00:06:00.810 --> 00:06:04.240
I'm sure it has H-scenes!
 It has to have H-scenes! H-scenes!

00:06:04.240 --> 00:06:05.400
Oh boy! Oh boy!

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:07.170
Don't keep yelling that!

00:06:07.170 --> 00:06:12.100
Makoto Kohsaka, a naughty
 little boy who dresses like a girl?

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:16.560
<b>{Sign copies dialogue}</b>

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:16.560
The name too? The staff got way too into it!

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:18.500
No, no, it's perfect!

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:19.950
Shut up!

00:06:20.590 --> 00:06:24.230
Did Madarame-sempai
 play it already, I wonder?

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:28.900
Did he finish the
 Kohsaka-sempai route? I bet he did!

00:06:28.950 --> 00:06:30.450
Then maybe...

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:34.660
Kohsaka-sempai asked Madarame-sempai 
what he thought about it?

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:39.460
No, I bet Kohsaka-sempai pressured him 
into saying what he thought about it!

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:40.850
Which means...

00:06:41.570 --> 00:06:43.110
Like this?

00:06:44.830 --> 00:06:47.310
Did you enjoy my route?

00:06:47.310 --> 00:06:50.090
It was okay, I guess.

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:53.960
I'm glad. It looks like you were satisfied.

00:06:53.960 --> 00:06:56.350
No... yes.

00:06:57.080 --> 00:06:58.750
If you want,

00:06:58.750 --> 00:07:03.860
I can do the same things I did in 
the game while wearing this costume.

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:08.050
And that's your cue!

00:07:08.560 --> 00:07:12.720
If he was interested in traps, I 
could tell him all about them.

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:16.680
What are you making me say?

00:07:16.680 --> 00:07:18.370
Perfect! Too perfect!

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:20.380
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

00:07:20.380 --> 00:07:22.780
I'll change clothes so you go away.

00:07:22.780 --> 00:07:26.300
Don't be so mean.

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:29.720
Those words came out because 
you were thinking them.

00:07:29.720 --> 00:07:32.340
I said shut up!

00:07:33.850 --> 00:07:35.310
Huh?

00:07:35.820 --> 00:07:39.330
Oh, Hato-kun? You here?

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:45.830
S-Sorry!

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:51.860
I wouldn't mind showing you everything...

00:07:56.530 --> 00:07:58.950
Say it! Say it! Say it!

00:07:58.950 --> 00:08:01.860
I can show you everything! 
In private lessons!

00:08:01.860 --> 00:08:05.400
And we'll have the initiative! 
A traditional top/bottom pairing!

00:08:06.580 --> 00:08:09.110
Enough! Stop fantasizing!

00:08:09.110 --> 00:08:10.710
There's more!

00:08:10.710 --> 00:08:12.650
I know! But I don't need it!

00:08:12.650 --> 00:08:14.830
Why?

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:20.190
Sorry! I'm still changing!

00:08:21.530 --> 00:08:25.160
Oh, sorry. I'll go take 
a walk around the block.

00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:26.440
I'm sorry!

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:28.900
Send me a text when you're done.

00:08:31.190 --> 00:08:33.750
Perfect timing!

00:08:33.750 --> 00:08:35.590
That's a go sign! A go sign!

00:08:35.590 --> 00:08:39.490
Oh no! I need to get rid of her or 
who knows what she'll make me say!

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:42.850
And why is sempai home so early today?

00:08:44.380 --> 00:08:46.900
I see... it's really been a long time

00:08:46.900 --> 00:08:49.600
since I've actually met sempai.

00:08:54.170 --> 00:08:56.370
I was a little too early, huh?

00:08:56.370 --> 00:08:59.440
Hato-kun's still there at this time of day.

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:00.980
Let's go home!

00:09:00.980 --> 00:09:03.030
Let's take Effort Street!

00:09:03.030 --> 00:09:07.930
Lately there hasn't been much 
work, so I'm leaving early a lot.

00:09:08.820 --> 00:09:12.780
I wonder if our company's okay. 
It's a depression, after all.

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:16.040
Is my bonus going to go down again?

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:18.570
Maybe I won't get one!

00:09:19.150 --> 00:09:23.090
Things have been pretty bad lately.

00:09:24.950 --> 00:09:26.460
There it is.

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:33.290
Roger.

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:42.900
What's wrong? You don't have to 
wait, you can go ahead and leave.

00:09:42.900 --> 00:09:44.080
Um...

00:09:44.880 --> 00:09:49.540
It's been a while since I've seen you, so I 
was wondering if we could chat for a bit.

00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:55.970
<b>I didn't apologize for what 
happened with Kuchiki-sempai.</b>

00:09:55.460 --> 00:09:57.840
<b>Talk
Confess Love
Quit</b>

00:09:56.010 --> 00:09:57.970
<b>It doesn't matter.</b>

00:09:57.950 --> 00:10:02.950
<b></b>

00:09:58.010 --> 00:10:02.970
<b>Oh, sorry.  My makeup's all sloppy, 
so please don't stare at me!</b>

00:10:02.470 --> 00:10:06.410
<b>Talk
Confess Love
Quit</b>

00:10:03.010 --> 00:10:06.430
<b>No, I can't tell! Did I 
make you hurry? Sorry.</b>

00:10:06.640 --> 00:10:10.400
No, no, no! Guy! Guy! Guy!

00:10:10.400 --> 00:10:14.650
<b>Talk
Confess Love
Quit</b>

00:10:11.060 --> 00:10:14.900
<b>Well, no sense in standing here. 
Want to go in?</b>

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:15.340
<b></b>

00:10:14.940 --> 00:10:15.360
<b>Okay...</b>

00:10:16.530 --> 00:10:18.500
<i>Guy!</i>

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:23.390
So how's your collaboration going?

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:26.500
I'm waiting to hear back from Hato-kun.

00:10:26.500 --> 00:10:30.310
Come to think of it, she's late 
today. Maybe she's not coming.

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:33.380
So could we do a gag strip?

00:10:33.380 --> 00:10:37.220
That would make the writing more important 
than the drawing. You up for that?

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:41.530
If it's Warring States 
jokes, I bet I could do it.

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:42.880
Seriously?

00:10:44.290 --> 00:10:47.460
Looks like they came together.

00:10:54.270 --> 00:10:56.110
Um, then...

00:10:56.890 --> 00:10:59.830
I can't make her sit on the bed.

00:10:59.830 --> 00:11:02.510
She was a guy last time, 
so it didn't matter, but...

00:11:02.510 --> 00:11:05.780
No, she's still a guy.

00:11:06.340 --> 00:11:08.350
She just smells nice.

00:11:08.350 --> 00:11:09.660
What am I doing?

00:11:10.950 --> 00:11:14.680
Sit down here. I'll sit over there.

00:11:14.680 --> 00:11:16.320
Okay.

00:11:19.310 --> 00:11:22.800
I noticed that when I got here.

00:11:22.960 --> 00:11:24.660
Did you?

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:27.900
I was changing here.

00:11:27.900 --> 00:11:31.710
You usually leave your doujinshi 
lying around anyway.

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:33.650
So, well...

00:11:33.650 --> 00:11:37.310
I think it's normal for 
a guy to do those things.

00:11:37.310 --> 00:11:39.670
Don't worry about it.

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:46.280
This situation's like one you'd see in 
a harem game or a light novel, isn't it?

00:11:46.280 --> 00:11:48.640
Or one where the title's 
written with four hiragana.

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:53.620
Or maybe something like <i>Me and My (Male) 
Underclassman Do Something or Other</i>?

00:11:54.120 --> 00:11:57.930
I'm sorry... I kind of did that deliberately.

00:11:57.930 --> 00:11:59.340
I thought I had to.

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:04.240
You don't play H-games, Hato-kun? 
You've got a PC, right?

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:06.630
No. I've never tried one.

00:12:06.630 --> 00:12:10.840
They're hard to get into,
 and they're not cheap.

00:12:10.840 --> 00:12:14.170
True. They're usually around 10,000 yen.

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:18.020
Buying clothes and makeup 
takes most of my money.

00:12:18.020 --> 00:12:19.590
Clothes, huh?

00:12:19.590 --> 00:12:23.330
I tried to buy nice clothes once.

00:12:23.330 --> 00:12:25.280
It was rough.

00:12:25.280 --> 00:12:26.490
You did?

00:12:26.490 --> 00:12:28.310
H-games may be expensive,

00:12:28.310 --> 00:12:32.390
but I seriously don't know how someone pays 
twenty or thirty thousand yen for a shirt.

00:12:32.390 --> 00:12:36.290
The nice part of being a salaryman is that 
you don't have to worry about your outfit.

00:12:36.820 --> 00:12:39.040
You just have to wear a necktie.

00:12:45.690 --> 00:12:47.400
I...

00:12:47.690 --> 00:12:51.850
BL stuff is all I can afford.

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:55.120
Then you're interested.

00:12:55.490 --> 00:12:56.600
Want to borrow this one?

00:12:57.990 --> 00:13:01.050
I didn't want to bring this up,

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:04.780
but isn't that the game Kohsaka-sempai 
was selling at Comic Festival?

00:13:04.780 --> 00:13:07.290
And isn't it a trap game?

00:13:07.290 --> 00:13:09.910
Oh, I didn't mean this one specifically!

00:13:09.910 --> 00:13:13.440
I've got others, like <i>DUCKY or UNDUCKY</i> 
and <i>Le Eden de la Grizzly Bear</i>.

00:13:13.440 --> 00:13:15.650
Any kind of H-Game you want!

00:13:15.990 --> 00:13:16.930
Right...

00:13:16.930 --> 00:13:21.480
Oh, uh, sorry. This is totally sexual 
harrassment, isn't it? Never mind.

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:25.130
If you want, I can let you borrow it, but...

00:13:25.130 --> 00:13:27.970
No, I couldn't!

00:13:27.970 --> 00:13:30.650
But if you could tell me what you 
thought about it, that would be fine.

00:13:30.650 --> 00:13:32.120
I see.

00:13:32.120 --> 00:13:36.870
Yeah... it's not the game I'm interested in.

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:39.230
It's what Madarame-sempai thought about it!

00:13:39.230 --> 00:13:41.920
What I thought...

00:13:41.980 --> 00:13:45.300
Well, I cleared a few of the routes, 
and the biggest surprise was...

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:48.360
I think all of them get 
pregnant in the ending.

00:13:48.360 --> 00:13:50.010
I-Is that so?

00:13:50.010 --> 00:13:54.280
Seriously. They just get pregnant.
No explanation at all.

00:13:54.280 --> 00:13:56.540
Traps are amazing.

00:13:57.930 --> 00:14:00.990
Well, they totally look like girls!

00:14:00.990 --> 00:14:05.010
In a way, they're a totally new 
gender. I guess it's pure fantasy.

00:14:05.010 --> 00:14:08.830
In BL, guys get pregnant all the time.

00:14:08.830 --> 00:14:12.350
But I shouldn't say that now. 
It would just confuse him.

00:14:12.590 --> 00:14:14.570
How was it as a game?

00:14:14.570 --> 00:14:17.920
A pretty typical H-game, I guess.

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:21.220
Well, I've never played one, but...

00:14:21.220 --> 00:14:25.750
Um... H-games are
 sometimes really sad, but...

00:14:25.750 --> 00:14:29.500
The usual reason you play one is...

00:14:32.520 --> 00:14:35.150
It was a normal H-game that way too.

00:14:35.150 --> 00:14:36.910
Very usable.

00:14:36.910 --> 00:14:38.020
Really?

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:42.610
The characters are lolis and
 have pigtails, the same as any girl.

00:14:42.610 --> 00:14:45.100
Basically they're just 
flat-chested characters.

00:14:45.100 --> 00:14:45.770
No...

00:14:45.770 --> 00:14:49.040
The way you play it is no different 
than any other H-game.

00:14:49.040 --> 00:14:52.980
I guess some of the things you do with them 
because they're traps would be the same as in BL.

00:14:52.980 --> 00:14:54.790
The same?

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:58.810
In BL, the character is a guy, but in a 
sex scene, he's basically a girl, right?

00:14:59.700 --> 00:15:00.960
Am I wrong?

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:05.710
Some women tend to view
 it in terms of gender theory.

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:06.540
Huh.

00:15:06.540 --> 00:15:08.120
Anyway...

00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:12.190
Forget BL. What's more important is...

00:15:12.190 --> 00:15:13.810
Sempai!

00:15:14.260 --> 00:15:17.140
Did you clear Kohsaka-sempai's route?

00:15:17.140 --> 00:15:19.640
Ah, there it is.

00:15:19.990 --> 00:15:22.580
This character, eh?

00:15:22.850 --> 00:15:26.820
Pregnancy ending! And in 
a maternity wedding dress!

00:15:27.980 --> 00:15:30.030
W-What?

00:15:30.030 --> 00:15:32.960
That's how far the two 
of them go in the game?

00:15:32.960 --> 00:15:35.530
They aren't just going to mimic 
what they did in the game!

00:15:35.560 --> 00:15:40.520
It's coming! It's coming! The two 
of them are going to get married!

00:15:41.310 --> 00:15:45.120
Huh? But does that make it a reverse 
coupling instead of Koh x Mada? Mada x Koh?

00:15:45.120 --> 00:15:47.640
I didn't like that character much.

00:15:47.640 --> 00:15:51.260
Her lines were all stuff I 
could see Kohsaka saying.

00:15:51.260 --> 00:15:52.720
Yeah?

00:15:52.940 --> 00:15:55.880
So, I should make this clear.

00:15:55.880 --> 00:15:57.180
What?

00:15:57.180 --> 00:16:00.160
I could NOT get off to the Kohsaka character!

00:16:00.550 --> 00:16:02.320
Seriously.

00:16:02.320 --> 00:16:04.430
I see.

00:16:04.430 --> 00:16:07.860
Too bad! Well, I'll 
fantasize about it anyway.

00:16:07.860 --> 00:16:13.200
This company... I wonder
 about them. They kind of scare me.

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:16.070
They are totally not
 going for mass market appeal.

00:16:17.100 --> 00:16:22.840
I wonder if Kasukabe-san
 knows about these kinds of games.

00:16:24.360 --> 00:16:29.250
I wonder how she'd feel if she knew her 
boyfriend was the model for an H-game character.

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:32.400
I see! If because of this game,

00:16:32.400 --> 00:16:36.370
Kohsaka-sempai and Kasukabe-sempai's
 relationship was strained...

00:16:36.700 --> 00:16:39.890
Madarame-sempai's got the 
chance to make a comeback!

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:44.270
Wait, maybe he said that because he's 
thinking about it right now! What should I do?

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:49.270
But would that be the end of the 
Mada x Koh marriage ceremony?

00:16:49.270 --> 00:16:50.700
What a waste!

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:54.840
I need to think of a Koh x Mada 
plot that includes Kasukabe-sempai!

00:16:56.530 --> 00:16:59.990
No, I guess I can't put her in BL.

00:17:02.680 --> 00:17:04.080
What?

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:05.330
Um... never mind.

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:09.540
You seemed to be deep in BL-land.

00:17:10.050 --> 00:17:12.260
I wasn't! Not exactly!

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:15.990
Well, it doesn't matter if 
I'm the bottom or anything.

00:17:17.010 --> 00:17:18.950
That's right! I have to talk about that!

00:17:19.230 --> 00:17:22.750
Um, I'm sorry... I know it's late 
to be getting to the point, but...

00:17:22.750 --> 00:17:24.390
Y-Yeah.

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:28.930
I spoke very harshly with 
Kuchiki-sempai! Very harshly!

00:17:28.930 --> 00:17:32.620
So I think it's okay for you to 
come back to the club room now.

00:17:32.620 --> 00:17:34.880
I'm really sorry!

00:17:37.220 --> 00:17:41.660
No, no, no, it's not something 
you need to apologize for.

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:43.870
Kuchiki-kun's just like that.

00:17:43.870 --> 00:17:48.830
True, it was pretty shocking, but...

00:17:50.990 --> 00:17:54.050
But I'd just been thinking that it 
was hard to be in the club room,

00:17:54.050 --> 00:17:58.050
now that it's all girls.

00:17:58.050 --> 00:18:02.260
And even if Kuchiki-kun 
doesn't come after me again,

00:18:02.260 --> 00:18:07.490
I don't suppose I can stop the girls from 
looking at me and going "total bottom".

00:18:07.990 --> 00:18:09.500
No...

00:18:09.960 --> 00:18:13.610
W-Wait, what direction is 
this conversation going in?

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:17.510
So lately, well...

00:18:17.510 --> 00:18:21.000
Well...

00:18:22.360 --> 00:18:26.410
It's not good for somebody who's graduated 
to hang around their old school forever.

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:29.860
I was just thinking about that.

00:18:30.760 --> 00:18:34.110
It seemed like staying there 
would just be awkward,

00:18:34.110 --> 00:18:37.820
so I thought maybe a change of 
scenery would be a good idea.

00:18:37.820 --> 00:18:40.890
What do you mean, exactly?

00:18:40.890 --> 00:18:45.260
Well... I can't say what exactly yet.

00:18:45.610 --> 00:18:48.230
But maybe finding a new job?

00:18:48.230 --> 00:18:53.030
Part of me's thinking I should 
get away from the university.

00:18:54.890 --> 00:18:56.230
It's my fault!

00:18:56.470 --> 00:18:59.840
Because I said
 Madarame-san is a total bottom!

00:18:59.840 --> 00:19:01.890
Because I'm always thinking about BL,

00:19:01.890 --> 00:19:05.370
or Koh x Mada and stuff!

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:11.260
Huh? Well, if I decided to move...

00:19:11.260 --> 00:19:15.020
It would mean you wouldn't be able to 
change, so I don't know about that.

00:19:15.020 --> 00:19:16.450
No...

00:19:16.560 --> 00:19:19.490
Don't worry about me.

00:19:19.490 --> 00:19:22.260
I can find other places to change.

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:27.070
No, well... I still don't know. Finding 
a new job is probably impossible anyway.

00:19:27.070 --> 00:19:29.520
T-That's right!

00:19:29.520 --> 00:19:33.820
The school fair is almost here, 
so make sure you come for that!

00:19:33.820 --> 00:19:36.410
Is it that time already?

00:19:36.410 --> 00:19:40.140
We've actually been having
 meetings in the club room lately.

00:19:40.140 --> 00:19:41.970
Not just talking about BL.

00:19:43.290 --> 00:19:45.180
What are you doing this year?

00:19:45.570 --> 00:19:49.040
Ohno-sempai is doing a cosplay try-on thing,

00:19:49.040 --> 00:19:52.140
and probably a special 
issue of <i>Mebaetame</i> too.

00:19:52.480 --> 00:19:55.480
We did cosplay last year,

00:19:55.480 --> 00:20:00.390
but you've been putting a lot of effort into 
<i>Mebaetame</i>, probably because Ogiue-sempai's president.

00:20:00.390 --> 00:20:01.090
Yes.

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:06.150
Are you drawing something? You
 always draw something for <i>Mebaetame</i>.

00:20:06.410 --> 00:20:12.010
Ogiue-sempai asked me to draw a normal manga.

00:20:12.010 --> 00:20:14.830
But I... I...

00:20:14.940 --> 00:20:17.210
I've only ever drawn BL.

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:20.190
It's all I can draw.

00:20:23.460 --> 00:20:27.740
Why not do that? Even if
 it's BL... just keep drawing.

00:20:30.380 --> 00:20:34.570
Even if it's the school fair, 
you should draw what you like.

00:20:34.570 --> 00:20:37.960
If it's really bad, Ogiue-san will stop you.

00:20:38.190 --> 00:20:42.850
The club room is probably a lot more 
lively now than when we were there.

00:20:43.200 --> 00:20:46.140
Even if he's being used for BL fantasies,

00:20:46.140 --> 00:20:49.680
he doesn't make people stop it.

00:20:51.390 --> 00:20:52.950
Sempai...

00:20:53.430 --> 00:20:55.820
Please come to the school fair.

00:20:55.820 --> 00:20:58.170
Yeah, I'll go.

00:20:58.470 --> 00:21:00.640
Looks like I can go without 
worrying about too much.

00:21:02.430 --> 00:21:05.590
I'll... I'll draw it!

00:21:05.570 --> 00:21:08.030
<b>Society for the Study 
of Modern Visual Culture</b>

00:21:06.440 --> 00:21:11.240
I'd like to try my best 
at drawing a non-BL manga.

00:21:11.640 --> 00:21:13.710
I-I see.

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:22.840
Then I'll make sure I'm ready.

00:21:23.400 --> 00:21:24.760
Thank you.

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:26.700
Yeah. You too.

00:23:10.110 --> 00:23:12.380
I want to ask at the top of my lungs:

00:23:10.110 --> 00:23:13.370
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:12.380 --> 00:23:14.410
Why does <i>Genshiken</i> not 
have a swimsuit episode?

00:23:14.410 --> 00:23:17.660
Most anime have at least one per 
season! Some have two or three!

00:23:15.950 --> 00:23:17.080
<b></b>

00:23:17.660 --> 00:23:19.460
We've got Comic Festival in summer.

00:23:19.460 --> 00:23:22.650
That no good! We need to show 
more skin if we're going to sell!

00:23:22.650 --> 00:23:24.940
Aren't guys in swimsuits 
more popular these days?

00:23:24.940 --> 00:23:28.700
You mean that one anime that's got swimsuits 
every episode? We can't lose to it!

00:23:28.700 --> 00:23:30.840
I'm ready to do my part!

00:23:30.840 --> 00:23:34.880
Legal lolis, sumo wrestling, and 
traps? Where's the demand for that?

00:23:34.880 --> 00:23:36.350
I think it's out there, somewhere.

00:23:36.350 --> 00:23:40.140
N-Next time on <i>Genshiken Second Generation:</i>
 White Gate Keeper!
